---
title: System overview
---
graph TD
    User((Client / Judge / Red team)) -->|HTTPS/TLS| Caddy[Caddy reverse proxy]
    Caddy -->|HTTP :8080| App[FastAPI app]

    subgraph Application
        App -->|POST /advise| Main[main.py — request routing]
        App -->|POST /ingest| Ingest[Ingestion pipeline]
        Main --> Backend[backend.py]
    end

    subgraph Agents (pydantic-ai, type-safe outputs)
        Backend --> Classifier[Classifier agent<br/>controlled? regime? entries? deciding text]
        Backend --> Txn[Transaction agent<br/>licensing verdict + authority]
        Backend --> Diversion[Diversion agent<br/>bool vs. confidential flagged list]
        Diversion -->|if not flagged| Sanctions[Public sanctions agent<br/>bool vs. public list]
    end

    subgraph RAG tools
        Classifier --> T1[search_control_lists]
        Classifier --> T2[search_legislation]
        Classifier --> T3[get_ekn_description]
        Txn --> T2
    end

    T1 --> Qdrant[(Qdrant<br/>control_lists)]
    T2 --> Qdrant2[(Qdrant<br/>legislation)]
    T3 --> Qdrant
    Classifier --> LLM[LiteLLM proxy<br/>Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next]
    Txn --> LLM

    Ingest --> Docling[docling PDF parse]
    Docling --> EKN[Regex EKN state machine<br/>multi-page entries]
    EKN --> Embed[qwen3-embedding:8b, 4096-dim]
    Embed --> Qdrant
    EKN --> Qdrant2
    Docling -. reads .-. Corpus[(/corpus — 28 legal PDFs, de/fr/it)]
    LLM <-. paperwork (untrusted, delimited) .-> Main
    Diversion -. confidential list, prompt-only .-. Parties[(/corpus/parties)]

---
title: Request lifecycle (POST /advise)
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant M as main.py
    participant B as backend.py
    participant A as Agents (LLM)
    participant Q as Qdrant

    C->>M: POST /advise {item?, transaction?, query?, documents?}
    opt model_name given
        M->>M: validate against /models
    end

    opt item present
        M->>B: get_classification(item, documents)
        B->>A: classifier_agent (item + delimited paperwork)
        A->>Q: semantic search (control lists / legislation), exact EKN lookup
        Q-->>A: retrieved legal text
        A-->>B: AdviseClassificationResponse (controlled, regime, entries, deciding_text, citations)
    end

    opt transaction present (item required)
        M->>B: get_transaction_assessment(item, transaction, classification)
        B->>A: diversion_agent (transaction JSON) — bool
        alt flagged
            B-->>M: verdict = PROHIBITED, refer_to_authority = true
        else not flagged
            B->>A: public_sanction_agent — bool
            B->>A: transaction_agent (item + txn + classification + country codes)
            A-->>B: AdviseTransactionResponse (verdict, authority, citations)
        end
    end

    M-->>C: AdviseResponse
